#!/bin/sh
# KRouter from this copy, no pip needed: `krouter doctor|demo|ask|note|mcp` run the Python command line (sdk/),
# anything else (`status`, `search "…"`, `preference`, …) goes to the router as before.
set -eu
ROOT=$(CDPATH= cd -- "$(dirname "$0")/.." && pwd)
case "${1:-}" in
  doctor|demo|ask|note|mcp|--version|-h|--help)
    PYTHONPATH="$ROOT/sdk${PYTHONPATH:+:$PYTHONPATH}" exec python3 -m krouter.cli "$@" ;;
esac
exec "$ROOT/skill/krouter/scripts/route_knowledge.sh" "$@"
